OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Freducing in number during the evening
OL,7,Fbut some continuing overnight, chiefly
OL,8,Faround western coasts where they could
OL,9,Fstill be heavy and thundery. Clear
OL,10,Fspells elsewhere and winds falling
OL,11,Flighter.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FAnother showery day, with a
OL,14,Ffew of these again possibly thundery
OL,15,Fwith hail and merging to longer spells
OL,16,Fof rain. Sunny spells mixed between.
OL,17,FFeeling fresher than of late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
