OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FBecoming more settled with an
OL,7,Fincreasing number of sunny spells.
OL,8,FSmall chance of a shower on Saturday.
OL,9,FTemperatures below average for August
OL,10,Fbut feeling pleasant where the
OL,11,Fsunshine emerges.
